      "message": "fix(app): say \"does not state all of the travel\" in the table note\n\nThe table note of a 3+2 first traverse said \"the machine states no X,\nY and Z travel\". fixture::table_of gives no table box also when only\none of the three is missing, so the note now says \"does not state all\nof the X, Y and Z travel\". The decision file quotes the new text and\nnames the mixed machine (a work-turning tilt with a head tilt) under\n\"Not judged (known)\". Both are notes of the review at 7e6e2ffe3.\n\nPinned by first_traverse_table::a_head_tilt_machine_with_no_travel_names_the_table_unjudged.\n\nRefs #2987\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
