        "date": "2026-11-20T21:07:35Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(sim): read the #2965 kinds at the post's traverse height\n\nThe fanuc post rapids Z to the higher of the clearance height and the\nstart (`traverseZ`) before the X/Y traverse. A rotary path opens at its\nown radial pose, which can stand under that plane (Rotary Offset beside\na standing bar opens at Z -10), so the law now reads the traverse\nheight for the rotary, multi-axis and cross-drill kinds. A cross drill\non a mill is refused at generation, so its test pins that refusal.\n\nRefs #2965\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
